# Allowlist: both Dockerfiles copy only pyproject.toml, README.md and backend/.
# Everything else stays out of the build context, which is the repo root for
# docker compose and `fly deploy` alike: without this, `fly deploy` uploads
# ~10 GB (desktop/, mobile/, .venv) plus .env, models/ and recordings/ to
# Fly's builder.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!backend/

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
